    "text": "Three tins, first seen in Australia in early May 2024 and in North America in early October 2024, each with three booster packs and three cosmos holofoil cards found in no booster pack: Larvitar, Pupitar and Tyranitar in the Tyranitar tin, Slakoth, Vigoroth and Slaking in the Slaking tin, all from Paldea Evolved, and Paldea Evolved's Sableye, Scarlet & Violet's Spiritomb and Obsidian Flames' Darkrai in the Darkrai tin.",
